NNAAMMEE
     ddttrraaccee__iipp — a DTrace provider for tracing events related to the IPv4 and
     IPv6 protocols

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     iipp::::::rreecceeiivvee(_p_k_t_i_n_f_o___t _*, _c_s_i_n_f_o___t _*, _i_p_i_n_f_o___t _*, _i_f_i_n_f_o___t _*,
